      "text": "气死我了",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wRkifsJjEJ-38?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105133373",
      "date": "26-11-20 14:53",
      "text": "这人到底会不会控盘啊，我真服了",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wRkifsJjEJ-38?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105133292",
      "date": "26-11-20 14:52",
      "text": "真牛逼，拉\n上证50\n，你可真nb啊",
