      "text": "还有你，二极管",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wRkifsJjEJ-12?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105235066",
      "date": "26-11-24 10:00",
      "text": "二极管，你咋不说话了",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wRkifsJjEJ-13?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105234513",
      "date": "26-11-24 09:55",
      "text": "我打错字了",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wRkifsJjEJ-13?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105234496",
      "date": "26-11-24 09:55",
      "text": "昨天二极管思维的兄弟，如何？",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wRkifsJjEJ-13?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105234021",
      "date": "26-11-24 09:50",
      "text": "之后，打错字",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wRkifsJjEJ-13?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105233854",
      "date": "26-11-24 09:48",
      "text": "市场比我想的要正常，海外顶上去自会后震荡和回落，国产没有发生二极管的负反馈，强更强的是情绪方向，目前量能是不够的。",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wRkifsJjEJ-13?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105233843",
      "date": "26-11-24 09:48",
      "text": "市场比我想的要正常，海外顶上去自会后震荡和回落，国产没有发生二极管的负反馈，强更强的是情绪方向，目前量能是不够的。",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wRkifsJjEJ-13?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105233030",
      "date": "26-11-24 09:36",
      "text": "之前仓位重的，可以趁普涨考虑一下",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wRkifsJjEJ-14?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105232742",
      "date": "26-11-24 09:29",
